## 3. Pipeline Architecture

### Full Pipeline Flow

```
supercronic (crontab)
→ pipeline_runner.py [workflows/orchestrator-15m.yaml | orchestrator-1h.yaml]
→ 7 parallel collectors (CUGA YAML tools → MCP servers)
→ merger.py (deduplication, signal merging)
→ validate_and_filter.py (23 gates)
→ decision_helpers.py + llm_client.py (Claude Sonnet 4.5)
→ alert_logger.py + notifier.py (Postgres + Discord)
→ chart_gen.py (candlestick chart attachments)
→ execution_trigger.py → execution_webhook.py (→ trade-execute)
```

### Parallel Schedules (America/New_York)

| Job | Schedule | Description |
|-----|----------|-------------|
| 15m pipeline | :30,:45 9h + */15 10-15h + :00 16h Mon-Fri | Main signal cycle |
| 1h pipeline | :00 10-16h Mon-Fri | Hourly regime cycle |
| Outcome tracker | */15 9-18h Mon-Fri | Position resolution |
| State summary | 9:15 + 16:10 Mon-Fri | Pre/post market summary |
| EOD summary | 16:20 Mon-Fri | End-of-day Discord report |
| Healthcheck | */15 24/7 | System health to health.jsonl |
| Data retention | Sun 03:00 | Purge old data |
| Langfuse purge | Sun 02:00 | Purge Langfuse datasets |

### Signal Types (11)

`technical_trend`, `volume_spike`, `sentiment_bull`, `sentiment_bear`,
`options_flow`, `insider_activity`, `relative_strength`, `macro_risk_off`,
`catalyst_event`, `short_interest`, `price_forecast`

