## 4. Infrastructure Stack

### Docker Services (24 containers, docker-compose.prod.yml)

**Infrastructure:**
- `vault` — HashiCorp Vault 1.15.0 (server mode, file backend, auto-unseal)
- `redis` — Redis 7 Alpine (appendonly, 512MB limit)
- `postgres` — pgvector/pgvector:pg16 (1GB limit, pgvector extension)
- `langfuse-db` — Postgres 16 Alpine (Langfuse backing store)
- `langfuse` — Langfuse v2 (self-hosted LLM tracing + prompt management)

**Application:**
- `cuga` — Main app container (`sleep infinity`, `exec docker compose exec`)
- `cron` — Supercronic scheduler running pipeline_runner.py
- `discord-bot` — Discord command handler (!scan, !status, !last)
- `dashboard` — FastAPI + uvicorn dashboard API (port 8080)

**MCP Servers (ports 8001–8012, profile: mcp):**

| Port | Service | Data Source |
|------|---------|-------------|
| 8001 | tradingview-mcp | TradingView |
| 8002 | polygon-mcp | Polygon.io |
| 8003 | discord-mcp | Discord |
| 8004 | finnhub-mcp | Finnhub |
| 8005 | rot-mcp | ROT signals |
| 8006 | edgar-mcp | SEC EDGAR |
| 8007 | yfinance-mcp | Yahoo Finance |
| 8008 | trading-mcp | Trading data |
| 8009 | fred-mcp | FRED macro |
| 8010 | spamshield-mcp | Spam filtering |
| 8011 | alpaca-mcp | Alpaca Markets |
| 8012 | timesfm-mcp | Google TimesFM (6GB, torch) |

**Observability:**
- `prometheus` — v2.53.0 (port 9090, 30d retention)
- `grafana` — v11.1.0 (port 3001)
- `pg-backup` — Daily pg_dump at 03:00 UTC (7-day retention)

### Networking

All services on `trade-net` bridge network. Ports bound to `127.0.0.1` by
default (configurable via `*_BIND` env vars). Langfuse exposed on `0.0.0.0:3000`.

### Secrets & Config

- Vault: `VAULT_ADDR=http://vault:8200`, path `secret/trade-alert`
- Redis: `REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379`
- Postgres: `DATABASE_URL` from Vault (`postgresql://USER@postgres:5432/trade_alert`)
- Langfuse: `LANGFUSE_HOST=http://langfuse:3000`
- LLM: Claude Sonnet 4.5 via LiteLLM (key from Vault)

