## 14. Git & PR Conventions

- **Branch names:** `feat/`, `fix/`, `chore/`, `docs/`, `refactor/` prefixes
- **Commit format:** Conventional Commits (`feat(gate): add VIX regime gate`)
- **Never force-push `main`**
- PRs touching pipeline-critical files (`pipeline_runner.py`, `validate_and_filter.py`,
  `execution_webhook.py`, `db.py`) require system test confirmation before merge
- Use the CHANGELOG.md (Keep a Changelog format) for all notable changes

